{"root":{"data":{"id":"dmdii1yjqbk0","created":1792890109866,"text":"心功能不全"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmdinz37me80","created":1792890573803,"text":"1.病因及分类"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmdiop34ulc0","created":1792890630394,"text":"什么是心功能不全/心衰？"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmdip7180hk0","created":1792890669461,"text":"心功能不全"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmdipi60sa80","created":1792890693696,"text":"由于心脏舒缩功能降低或心室充盈受限\n导致的心脏泵血功能降低。\n包括代偿期和失代偿期","layout":null,"color":"#ff0000","background":"#daeef3","font-weight":"bold"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmdiqkp89co0","created":1792890777575,"text":"心力衰竭"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmdiqn4lk4g0","created":1792890782858,"text":"在有足够循环血量的情况下，由于心脏舒缩功能障碍，\n导致心排血量绝对/相对不足，不能满足机体代谢需要\n而导致的以循环功能为主的综合征。\n是心功能不全的失代偿期","layout":null,"font-weight":"bold","color":"#ff0000","background":"#daeef3"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmdio652fs00","created":1792890589152,"text":"2.发生机制"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmdio9drp3k0","created":1792890596209,"text":"3.对机体的影响"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmdiogfdhiw0","created":1792890611543,"text":"4.防止原则"},"children":[]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}